# Risk-Management Solutions across the Logistics Journey — Value Chain Mapping (Worldwide Scan)

**Run ID:** 2026-05-21-0115
**Mode:** sandbox (overnight unattended; Phase 2 attended-fetch enrichment to follow)
**Geography:** Worldwide; SEA (Singapore, Indonesia, Thailand, Malaysia) flagged as target deployment market
**Downstream consumer:** Tokio Marine + ID&E venture pitch competitive-landscape section, prepared by Wright Partners
**Gate decision:** SHIP-WITH-FLAG (27.9% Low confidence across 305 claims, 6 stages; 3 priority corrections applied — Kargo Tech active vs bankrupt, APAC protection gap ~$441B vs $740B, fictitious-pickup growth rephrased to CargoNet-aligned ~574 events / +50% YoY)

## Table of contents

1. Stage 1 — Pre-dispatch: Vendor procurement & onboarding
2. Stage 2 — Dispatch: Freight procurement & tendering
3. Stage 3 — In-transit: Visibility & monitoring
