5. Stage 5 — Delivery: POD, last-leg verification & security
6. Stage 6 — Post-incident: Claims, insurance & recovery

## Method note

Unit of analysis is the **solution** (software / hardware / service / hybrid), not the carrier or commodity actor. The "value chain" is the freight journey itself — six sequential stages. Within each stage we catalog the named solutions that address risk at that stage. Both digital (TMS, RTTVPs, IoT, ePOD, parametric InsurTech) and non-digital (convoys, surveyors, paper POD, WhatsApp networks) are first-class.

For every solution we note country of origin, current geographic coverage, business model, last-known funding / public-company status, and **SEA presence** (offices / resellers / customers / local-language / local-regulation support) — because the venture targets SEA but research scope is global to spot whitespace.

